WEBVTT

00:20.080 --> 00:22.460
Akashi, we're going to retreat for now!

00:23.540 --> 00:24.670
Minashi?

00:25.210 --> 00:27.340
What's the meaning of this?

00:33.340 --> 00:34.380
We don't stand a chance!

00:34.380 --> 00:35.130
We need to escape!

00:35.840 --> 00:38.550
Why are you...

00:38.550 --> 00:40.640
Why is a MA-Vess...

00:40.640 --> 00:44.140
Akashi! Open your eyes and take a good hard look!

00:44.140 --> 00:46.600
<i>We</i> are right here.

00:47.690 --> 00:50.440
We?

01:03.120 --> 01:08.710
The Dark Metal

01:08.710 --> 01:13.130
Night turns to day, and day turns to night. Our wishes have wilted away

01:13.130 --> 01:17.300
Where did the person I want to meet go?

01:17.300 --> 01:21.760
Interlocking these fingers with my beloved

01:21.760 --> 01:25.520
Even though I can't feel them, I continue to live

01:25.560 --> 01:30.150
When the flower's petals

01:30.150 --> 01:34.280
Are plucked off by the wind's playful gale

01:34.280 --> 01:38.740
They are scattered in every direction

01:38.740 --> 01:44.080
Even if you long for it

01:45.080 --> 01:49.790
Don't disappear, just don't

01:49.790 --> 01:53.590
I can even give everything else away if I have to

01:53.590 --> 01:58.430
You were there, and I was there with you

01:58.430 --> 02:02.760
Let me take in these memories

02:02.760 --> 02:09.690
These brief moments are connected, turning it into eternity

02:26.500 --> 02:30.540
Episode 13
Roar of the Beast

02:32.380 --> 02:32.960
Why?

02:32.960 --> 02:34.550
Dunno...

02:34.550 --> 02:37.420
But they said we didn't need to swap tomorrow.

02:38.880 --> 02:42.510
I'm sure Sasame and Minashi want to take baths too.

02:42.510 --> 02:43.470
Hey...

02:44.430 --> 02:47.140
Don't you think things have been pretty fishy as of late?

02:47.140 --> 02:48.770
Fishy?

02:49.730 --> 02:51.310
Swap out, swap out...

02:51.770 --> 02:54.360
Wait, where are Minashi and Sasame?

02:54.360 --> 02:55.650
They're not here?

02:55.650 --> 02:56.820
Weren't we going to swap?

02:56.820 --> 03:00.450
It looks like they're taking their time with preparations,

03:00.450 --> 03:02.450
so you can head back for now.

03:02.450 --> 03:03.780
Okay...

03:02.950 --> 03:03.780
Is that so?

03:04.200 --> 03:07.290
When you get back, make sure to get screened properly.

03:08.200 --> 03:10.040
Okay...

03:10.920 --> 03:14.670
The fact that we didn't see them bothers me.

03:16.420 --> 03:17.670
It can't be...

03:23.890 --> 03:27.390
What do you mean by "we"?

03:37.360 --> 03:39.070
Come on, this way.

04:01.550 --> 04:02.510
All right!

04:05.010 --> 04:05.970
We're retreating!

04:07.260 --> 04:08.310
Akashi!

04:09.350 --> 04:10.930
S-Sure...

04:26.450 --> 04:29.660
We can't seem to catch Argent nor Gueules.

04:30.450 --> 04:33.080
We're even using four of the SDF's parabola units.

04:33.080 --> 04:37.420
I'd like to increase the chances of getting a hold of their data.

04:37.420 --> 04:40.920
Since we don't know when the
Lightless Realm's effects will weaken,

04:40.920 --> 04:42.010
don't let your guard down.

04:42.010 --> 04:43.670
R-Right!

04:44.220 --> 04:48.930
If we let our guard down, I feel like even I'll be crushed by the weight of our sins.

04:49.890 --> 04:53.100
Kasane, are you all right with this?

04:53.640 --> 04:58.480
Having IX request help from the Self-Defense Force...

04:58.480 --> 05:00.650
She's pretty good.

05:00.650 --> 05:05.910
They can't refuse when she threatens to make a report about the LIMs.

05:05.910 --> 05:12.120
We should just make this sublime theory of ours public right now.

05:12.120 --> 05:14.870
It's a sin to keep it secret so long.

05:14.870 --> 05:16.120
So?

05:16.120 --> 05:18.830
Did you figure out anything about the inside?

05:18.830 --> 05:19.880
No.

05:19.880 --> 05:21.090
Figures.

05:21.090 --> 05:24.260
The two inside Gueules are genuine,

05:24.260 --> 05:27.430
so we just need to eagerly await for their return.

05:27.430 --> 05:29.600
It'll be loads of fun.

05:29.600 --> 05:31.390
Just what kind of data will they bring us?

05:33.850 --> 05:37.310
It's been a while since I've been this excited.

05:40.020 --> 05:45.280
Gueules, Argent, and Sable... Hurry back home already.

05:45.280 --> 05:50.490
Having all three mischievous
MA-Vesses in front of my eyes...

05:50.490 --> 05:53.080
I'm already looking forward to it.

06:01.000 --> 06:04.090
Hey, are we really going to head back like this?

06:04.090 --> 06:06.920
It's better to start over now.

06:06.920 --> 06:09.010
In any case, let's leave the Lightless Realm.

06:09.010 --> 06:11.510
But I have to get the Corpse.

06:11.510 --> 06:13.220
That's impossible in your present state.

06:14.180 --> 06:15.520
To keep you alive.

06:16.180 --> 06:17.980
That's why we came here.

06:17.980 --> 06:19.350
What do you keep going on about?!

06:20.560 --> 06:23.730
Always saying, "we this," "we that." I've had enough!

06:23.730 --> 06:27.950
A MA-Vess being here means that someone became a LIM!

06:27.950 --> 06:29.740
Even I can understand that much!

06:29.740 --> 06:31.450
Who is it?

06:31.450 --> 06:34.160
Who is it? Who the hell is in that thing?!

06:38.290 --> 06:39.830
That tree...

06:57.890 --> 07:02.190
We can withstand the Lightless Realm's corruption for a little while here.

07:08.030 --> 07:09.150
Tell me.

07:10.780 --> 07:13.120
You should know who it is already.

07:14.330 --> 07:15.370
It's Sasame.

07:16.700 --> 07:19.620
The LIM on Gueules is Sasame.

07:27.760 --> 07:28.840
Liar.

07:29.300 --> 07:31.840
That just can't be...

07:31.840 --> 07:33.260
What are you talking about?

07:33.260 --> 07:34.890
Because...

07:34.890 --> 07:36.180
Sasame...

07:36.930 --> 07:39.230
Do you want to see for yourself?

07:40.560 --> 07:43.350
You can look at who the LIM for Gueules is.

07:47.020 --> 07:48.230
Impossible.

07:48.230 --> 07:53.660
We promised that she would
wait until the Corpse was defeated.

07:54.620 --> 07:58.490
What you're saying is impossible!

08:05.040 --> 08:07.420
It was her wish and her wish alone.

08:08.420 --> 08:12.720
To become a LIM so that she could protect everyone.

08:14.430 --> 08:15.970
She wished for it?

08:15.970 --> 08:18.560
And you just silently accepted it?!

08:18.560 --> 08:20.470
Of course I did.

08:20.470 --> 08:23.520
I won't ever believe that...

08:23.520 --> 08:26.650
She's in the Lightless Realm with Minashi by now.

08:27.150 --> 08:30.900
She'd never wish to turn herself into a LIM!

08:30.900 --> 08:31.900
That's right!

08:31.900 --> 08:34.780
We only heard your side of the story when this happened to Emiru too!

08:34.780 --> 08:37.990
Emiru also wished for it.

08:37.990 --> 08:38.740
Emiru...

08:39.620 --> 08:41.200
Emiru's heart...

08:42.460 --> 08:45.370
It was screaming for help.

08:45.620 --> 08:50.630
No, no. She wanted to turn her life around.

08:50.630 --> 08:52.470
That can't be true!

08:52.470 --> 08:54.720
Emiru would never think that.

08:55.630 --> 08:56.640
But you see...

08:57.600 --> 09:02.430
LIMs don't come to be without them wishing for it.

09:12.900 --> 09:14.950
I'll stay right next to you.

09:19.740 --> 09:21.910
Sasame, your heart is crying.

09:24.160 --> 09:26.540
Akashi-kun told me

09:27.500 --> 09:33.130
that if I became a LIM, his heart
would never be able to be saved.

09:34.630 --> 09:38.640
I promised him that I would wait.

09:38.640 --> 09:41.220
I have to keep my promise to Akashi-kun.

09:42.560 --> 09:43.520
But still...

09:45.430 --> 09:47.440
Sasame, your heart is screaming.

09:48.560 --> 09:51.820
And at this rate, the promise you made with Akashi—

09:51.820 --> 09:57.740
or rather, your heart that made the promise—all of it will be gone.

10:10.250 --> 10:11.880
But I won't let you lose them.

10:12.670 --> 10:15.170
I'll take on your heart for you, Sasame.

10:15.710 --> 10:19.890
I'll always stay by your side
and take you to where Akashi is.

10:22.100 --> 10:25.600
This is the promise I'm making to you, Sasame.

11:08.020 --> 11:10.190
So you're saying you stayed quiet and watched.

11:11.060 --> 11:12.940
as she became a LIM?

11:14.150 --> 11:15.020
Yeah.

11:15.730 --> 11:17.530
Don't screw with me!

11:17.530 --> 11:21.780
If I'd beaten the Corpse, we might've stopped the Necrometal corruption!

11:21.780 --> 11:23.320
I was doing this to protect her!

11:23.320 --> 11:26.540
But you were the one who was protected.

11:27.790 --> 11:28.910
I...

11:28.910 --> 11:31.120
Had she waited for your return,

11:31.120 --> 11:34.630
she wouldn't have been able to become a LIM
and would've died, leaving nothing but her regrets.

11:38.420 --> 11:41.300
Sasame's heart had been set from the very beginning.

11:42.470 --> 11:45.890
If she didn't have that promise with you...

11:47.310 --> 11:49.850
Why'd you make such a promise you couldn't keep?

11:51.270 --> 11:58.440
You wanted to protect her, but can you even imagine how much pain your selfishness caused her heart?

12:02.200 --> 12:05.990
You're the type of person that's most vicious, don't you think?

12:05.990 --> 12:08.200
You're downright cold-hearted,

12:08.200 --> 12:11.290
yet you act just a bit nice,
as if you were making an excuse.

12:11.290 --> 12:12.410
You don't recall?

12:12.410 --> 12:15.670
Didn't you make multiple people cry?

12:20.300 --> 12:21.300
That's not it!

12:21.300 --> 12:22.510
I...

12:24.590 --> 12:25.930
What a pity.

12:29.430 --> 12:32.600
I feel so sorry for Sasame.

12:34.940 --> 12:36.440
What are you saying?

12:37.770 --> 12:39.480
Sasame's...

12:39.480 --> 12:41.610
You wouldn't understand her feelings!

12:42.610 --> 12:43.570
I understand.

12:46.780 --> 12:48.160
Because...

12:49.450 --> 12:51.330
we are one, after all.

13:02.550 --> 13:04.630
Looks like we're out of time.

13:04.630 --> 13:05.380
Let's go.

13:17.980 --> 13:19.900
I will never forgive...

13:28.660 --> 13:29.780
We're going to escape.

13:29.780 --> 13:31.040
Follow me!

13:33.700 --> 13:34.660
Akashi!

13:35.210 --> 13:35.870
...the Corpse!

13:36.710 --> 13:37.830
I will never...

13:40.540 --> 13:41.880
...forgive you!

13:43.340 --> 13:44.840
Wait, Akashi!

13:52.010 --> 13:53.600
You can't, Akashi!

13:53.600 --> 13:56.980
Sasame wished for you to return alive!

13:58.940 --> 14:00.900
I'll never forgive you!

14:09.160 --> 14:10.620
Akashi!

14:10.620 --> 14:13.330
Dammit!

14:24.920 --> 14:26.260
Why...

14:26.260 --> 14:30.050
Why aren't you trying to understand how she felt?!

15:05.250 --> 15:07.090
Sasame...

15:07.090 --> 15:08.590
Just stop this already.

15:09.880 --> 15:12.430
Anything I do now is useless.

15:12.970 --> 15:16.350
I didn't have the right to protect Sasame.

15:17.020 --> 15:18.310
I never did.

15:20.230 --> 15:26.940
Yet I made a selfish promise and even made her suffer.

15:26.940 --> 15:28.900
What was that about waiting for me?

15:29.650 --> 15:31.530
I can't protect anything.

15:31.530 --> 15:33.700
I can't save anyone.

15:33.700 --> 15:39.330
I'm nothing more than a scumbag
who's always been protected by others.

15:59.890 --> 16:01.100
Akashi!

16:20.870 --> 16:25.290
I guess Aoshi has abandoned me now too.

16:30.130 --> 16:32.300
Of course he would.

16:32.300 --> 16:34.260
I'm not worth protecting at all.

16:36.090 --> 16:38.180
The one who deserves to die the most...

16:39.720 --> 16:40.810
...is me.

16:49.480 --> 16:51.530
Just kill me...

16:52.950 --> 16:54.030
Akashi-kun.

17:04.710 --> 17:06.000
Sasame?

17:12.130 --> 17:13.470
Akashi-kun...

17:14.510 --> 17:17.050
I'll protect you, Akashi-kun.

17:17.890 --> 17:22.890
So you really did turn into a LIM, Sasame.

17:30.270 --> 17:30.980
Sasame!

17:38.870 --> 17:41.830
Akashi! Hurry up and get out of there!

17:42.410 --> 17:44.370
Protecting you at any cost...

17:44.370 --> 17:47.210
That's the promise I made to Sasame!

17:49.670 --> 17:51.250
Don't fuck with me...

17:52.960 --> 17:54.720
Hurry up!

17:54.720 --> 17:56.220
Akashi!

17:58.470 --> 18:00.180
Don't fuck with me!

18:02.350 --> 18:04.640
I'll kill you...

18:39.890 --> 18:41.010
Akashi!

18:43.810 --> 18:47.100
What in the world is going on?

18:50.940 --> 18:53.070
You can't, Akashi!

18:54.360 --> 18:55.400
Emiru?

18:56.360 --> 18:58.200
I'll kill you!

19:23.720 --> 19:25.810
You can't, Akashi.

19:26.930 --> 19:32.440
At this rate, you'll just become a Reaper that will never return to being human.

19:54.540 --> 20:03.470
Toss a coconut onto the black of Corpses...

19:59.590 --> 20:01.840
The Corpse's song?

20:03.680 --> 20:08.140
Suspicions of Charon and Garon...

20:08.930 --> 20:16.400
One, meddling in affairs of crying children...

20:17.650 --> 20:24.410
Two, burn the bones of crying children...

20:24.410 --> 20:32.080
Three, atop the carcass is a crying child...

20:30.580 --> 20:32.080
Sasame?

20:32.080 --> 20:36.540
Quiet, just be quiet, suspicions of Corpses...

20:36.960 --> 20:42.510
Scattered into ashes, here, Garon...

21:15.040 --> 21:15.920
Akashi!

21:29.470 --> 21:30.890
Sasame...

21:42.110 --> 21:46.450
There are metallic particles presumed to be Necrometal emitting from Lightless Realm!

21:46.450 --> 21:48.200
Wide dispersal is ongoing!

21:48.820 --> 21:50.080
What did you say?!

21:55.660 --> 21:56.580
No way...

21:56.580 --> 22:00.040
What's that? What the hell is this?!

22:03.510 --> 22:05.220
Oh...

22:05.220 --> 22:07.630
He's done quite a remarkable feat.

22:09.680 --> 22:11.220
Impossible...

22:44.750 --> 22:55.390
Throwing away all my excuses, I traced over my abrased heart

22:55.390 --> 22:59.940
In the coldness of the locker room,

22:59.940 --> 23:06.400
Was an unfulfilled promise, locked away

23:06.900 --> 23:12.870
Dispel the darkness in this fallen world,

23:12.870 --> 23:17.410
And give me a reason why I should continue living

23:17.410 --> 23:22.790
The meaning of good-byes, the expectations of people,

23:22.790 --> 23:27.670
And the melodies that we played while never crossing paths

23:27.670 --> 23:33.390
I know I must not run away. The only path is straight ahead

23:33.390 --> 23:37.890
Even if this turns out to be a mistake

23:37.890 --> 23:43.480
The whirlpools of destiny will consume all loneliness

23:43.480 --> 23:51.570
It is an unerasable scar, an egoism that cannot be discarded

24:04.960 --> 24:09.960
Episode 14

24:04.960 --> 24:09.960
Sounds of Regret
